<h1>Mike Porfirio</h1>
<p>Illinois Senate, 11th District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Bills he has sponsored, as listed on ilga.gov, center on veterans&#39; affairs and procurement preferences for veteran-owned businesses, first responder support, transportation, local government operations and property taxes. We could not find a published 2026 campaign platform.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>A Naval Academy graduate and Navy Reserve officer who served in Iraq and Afghanistan, he was administrator of the Village of Summit, public works director in Bridgeview and a Lyons Township trustee before his 2022 election to the Senate.</p>
